data: {"id": "3f86d4d7d5a24fd6-final", "run_id": "3f86d4d7d5a24fd6", "seq": 1369, "ts_ms": 1788761411575, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | `phase: Pending`, `nodeName: None` (fact-69745d1a78a7) | 确认 Pod 始终处于未调度状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | default-scheduler | `FailedScheduling 18m` 消息: \"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available...\" (fact-2b6b874aaee8) | 直接指出失败原因为节点亲和性/选择器不匹配，且无法通过抢占解决 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Pod Spec (Container: app) | `requests: {cpu: 5m, memory: 8Mi}`, `limits: {cpu: 50m, memory: 32Mi}` (fact-0c950f027b7e) | 确认资源请求极小，排除因资源不足导致的调度失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | kube_pod_status_phase | `phase=Running` 对应的值为 `0` (fact-0e10f193d99c) | 侧面印证无正常运行 Pod，与 K8s State 一致 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nK8s State 和 Event 共同锁定了 Pending 的根本原因是“节点亲和性/选择器不匹配”。K8s Config 确认了资源消耗极低，排除了资源竞争的可能。Metric 数据佐证了该工作负载处于未运行状态。日志与追踪因容器未启动而无数据，符合预期。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 配置了节点选择器 (如: aiops.lab/unavailable=true) → 集群中所有节点标签不匹配该选择器 → 调度器返回 FailedScheduling (0/3 nodes available) → Pod 保持 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 的调度配置（节点选择器/亲和性规则）要求节点具备特定标签，但集群中所有 3 个节点均不满足该标签要求，导致默认调度器无法找到可用节点，Pod 被挂起（Pending）。\n- **支持证据**：Event 明确报告 `node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` (证据 #2)；Config 证明非资源问题 (证据 #3)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 30.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52: 32.2s (Evidence 26.3s, RCA 5.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52**: pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.972, "metrics": {"run_id": "3f86d4d7d5a24fd6", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.97883701324463, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 70978.83701324463, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 68140.22827148438, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6262.672424316406, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2415.360450744629}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 30042.55771636963, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 32202.006101608276, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8704.771280288696, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

